        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/marrakesh/_scene_spider.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 9fd5a22c-0bee-4a8e-9788-cd80f65fcd73).Image",
        "Description": "47, Mohler&apos;s grieving widow has decided to further investigate his death and found the man impersonating her husband to be under the command of a Moroccan Major named Hudhaifah Mushtaq Shadid, who appears to have been the one who ordered the impersonator through cryptic emails. Shadid also stranely meets with a man named Amjad Abdelnour, a nobody, likely former SIA. Further intel suggests Abdelnour works for the Al-Ghazali&apos;s as a fixer. We will enquire further. Happy hunting 47.",
